error: #[n_vm::config] marks a `const` inside the body of a #[n_vm::test] function, and is consumed by it; e.g.

       #[n_vm::test]
       fn my_test() {
           #[n_vm::config]
           const _: n_vm::VmConfig = n_vm::VmConfigBuilder::default().iommu(true).build();

           // the test body follows
       }

       Only the top level of the body is searched, so a marker nested inside an inner function, closure or block is not found.
